---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Current vacancies
quote: >-
  Advertised <a href="/join-us/#phd">PhD</a> and <a href="/join-us/#postdocs">postdoctoral</a> positions in the AIM Lab. Before applying to any advert, enquire by email as set out under <a href="/join-us/#how-to-apply">How to apply</a>.
---
{# Advertised PhD and postdoctoral positions, in the format of the Aeronautics
 PhD opportunity adverts. One Markdown file per vacancy in this folder's
 vacancies/ subfolder; see vacancies/TEMPLATE.txt for the fields. Delete the
 file when the position is filled, or rename it away from .md to withhold it
 (only .md files are published). With no files the page shows the first
 sentence below; keep its date current. While no vacancy has `level: Postdoc`,
 the page says so and points to the fellowships and how to apply. #}

{% set list = collections.vacancy | sort(false, true, 'data.closing') %}
{% set postdocs = [] %}
{% for v in list %}{% if v.data.level == "Postdoc" %}{% set _ = postdocs.push(v) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
{% if not list.length or not postdocs.length %}
  <div class="page__body">
    {% if not list.length %}<p>A PhD vacancy will be posted in mid-October 2026.</p>{% endif %}
    {% if not postdocs.length %}<p>There are currently no postdoctoral vacancies. Read about the <a href="/join-us/postdoc-fellowships/">fellowship opportunities</a> and <a href="/join-us/#how-to-apply">how to apply</a>.</p>{% endif %}
  </div>
{% endif %}

{% if list.length %}
  <h2 class="subheading" id="toc">List of vacancies</h2>
  <ul class="sp-toc">
  {% for v in list %}
    <li><a href="#{{ v.fileSlug | lower }}">{{ v.data.title }}</a> ({{ v.data.level }}{% if v.data.reference %}, {{ v.data.reference }}{% endif %})</li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ul>

  {% for v in list %}
  <article class="sp" id="{{ v.fileSlug | lower }}">
    <h2 class="sp__title">{{ v.data.title }} <span class="sp__level">({{ v.data.level }})</span></h2>
    <dl class="sp__meta">
      {% if v.data.reference %}<dt>Reference</dt><dd>{{ v.data.reference }}</dd>{% endif %}
      {% if v.data.start %}<dt>Start date</dt><dd>{% if v.data.start.getTime %}{{ v.data.start | dateISO }}{% else %}{{ v.data.start }}{% endif %}</dd>{% endif %}
      {% if v.data.closing %}<dt>Closing date</dt><dd>{% if v.data.closing.getTime %}{{ v.data.closing | dateISO }}{% else %}{{ v.data.closing }}{% endif %}</dd>{% endif %}
      {% if v.data.duration %}<dt>Duration</dt><dd>{{ v.data.duration }}</dd>{% endif %}
      {% if v.data.eligibility %}<dt>Eligibility</dt><dd>{{ v.data.eligibility }}</dd>{% endif %}
      {% if v.data.supervisors %}<dt>Supervisors</dt><dd>{{ v.data.supervisors | join(", ") }}</dd>{% endif %}
      {% if v.data.funding %}<dt>Funding</dt><dd>{{ v.data.funding }}</dd>{% endif %}
    </dl>
    <div class="page__body">
      {{ v.templateContent | safe }}
      {% if v.data.requirements %}
      <h3 class="subheading">Requirements</h3>
      <ul>{% for r in v.data.requirements %}<li>{{ r }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
      {% endif %}
      <h3 class="subheading">How to apply</h3>
      <p>{% if v.data.apply %}{{ v.data.apply | safe }}{% else %}Apply through <a href="https://www.imperial.ac.uk/study/pg/apply/how-to-apply/">Imperial's online application system</a>, naming Dr. Chen as proposed supervisor and quoting the reference above.{% endif %}{% if v.data.link %} The official advert is <a href="{{ v.data.link }}">here</a>.{% endif %}</p>
      <p>Questions about the project: <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Dr. Chen</a>.{% if v.data.admin %} Questions about the application process: {{ v.data.admin | safe }}.{% endif %}</p>
    </div>
  </article>
  {% topLink %}
  {% if not loop.last %}{% sectionRule %}{% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
{% endif %}
